# The canonical RDF 1.2 reifier: x rdf:reifies <<( s p o )>>, with accordingTo (st) and
# hasAvailableEvidence (ev) folded onto the same reifier subject in ONE record. The three
# triples are authored as separate statements on the shared subject (identical GMN-0 model).

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

gmeow:reifier1 rdf:reifies <<( gmeow:doorGate1 gmeow:hasState logic:Open )>> .
gmeow:reifier1 gmeow:accordingTo gmeow:sensorStandpoint .
gmeow:reifier1 gmeow:hasAvailableEvidence gmeow:span42 .
